OL,3,GNEWSALewes Bonfire 2026: All you need
OL,4,Ato know
OL,5,
OL,6,FTens of thousands of people are
OL,7,Fexpected in Lewes on Thursday for the
OL,8,Ftown's annual bonfire celebrations.
OL,10,FThe event sees effigies paraded through
OL,11,Fthe town centre, culminating in a huge
OL,12,Fbonfire and firework display.
OL,14,FLewes residents have been advised to
OL,15,Fget vehicles home before 16:00 GMT to
OL,16,Favoid any road closures in place.
OL,18,FVisitors have been urged to stay away
OL,19,Fand not to bring cars into the town.
